448448036", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822581_1233526451781369_7479849779421110855_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oNZTe385-YcQ7kNvwFRKonR&_nc_oc=AdkILC8naP3kkEHBKT5vGv5B6_6QzlbAWslbuUDdfZm3hHpPBoLs_6wSAFgTuyAPJu4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs2UDJbd3hRlWwjW7mFLg6MRoRoWED3mt8zNN200Lhjbg&oe=69A03690"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "ExitConditionOne_MainCover_w_Captions 2560 x 1440 safe.png", "id": "1215321857033813", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619063_1215321860367146_683015123330448268_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j5r5qut6AhIQ7kNvwEnNTZb&_nc_oc=AdkFyVK-QO1yd4efadLfVqPvIdfyBnMyN0jcrQ4CZVvxh_Ubo5L5ZjhprqRBTpdO1nY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuT8pmf38B2GpiPhHHjoqsiw9OOuOaAG9TJhy7QL1gXAQ&oe=69A054F6"}, "display_name": "Escape Room Exit Condition One HD", "keywords": ["escape", "scifi"], "long_description": "You'll need to overcome dozens of puzzling challenges by crafting tools, remote controlling drones, rewiring circuits, climbing, playing Match-3 games, shooting, and even dancing! There's five distinct levels expanding from a small chamber to a cathedral-like boss level.\n{1867939200771207}\nThere are 13 achievements, 4 collectible series, and dancing and match-3 based shooting mini-games unlocked along the way.\n{756005933743740}\nThere's even a chatty robot companion and if that's not enough you can talk to us on **Discord** here: https://discord.gg/hBcfWrezhD\n{2049227882550659}\nPlease note: roomscale mode requires a 3m x 2m guardian.", "short_description": "A roomscale puzzle adventure with escape room bones. Four main levels, a boss level, collectibles and a shooting mini-game. Puzzles include wiring, search, match 3, dancing, climbing, drones and much more."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://exitconditions.com/privacy-policy/", "develo